WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The first answer is not the only answer.
Same brief. No clear point of view.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
Start with Pixelcraft.
Install the skills in your coding agent.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Give it a real brief. Audience. Constraints. Intent.
Illustrative agent session, not a live model response.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Explore genuinely different directions.
Score the tradeoffs. Choose with intent.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Same brief. A different point of view.
Build the whole experience, not just the first screen.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
Every surface has its own language.
Mobile. Desktop. Terminal. And beyond.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Plan. Frame. Diverge. Specify. Build. Verify. Report.
Evidence, not “looks good”. Say what was actually checked.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
Pixelcraft. Less default. More deliberate.
Open source. MIT licensed. Your next interface starts here.
